    "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* Tear down tests using python from venv by @aeliton in https://github.com/python-rope/rope/pull/835\r\n* Update and pin black version in pre-commit and Github Actions by @lieryan in https://github.com/python-rope/rope/pull/850\r\n* Update supported python version by @lieryan in https://github.com/python-rope/rope/pull/851\r\n* Add Python 3.13 classifier by @yangfan-yf-yf in https://github.com/python-rope/rope/pull/846\r\n* Implement patchedast for TypeAlias and TypeVar/TypeVar/ParamSpec syntax by @lieryan in https://github.com/python-rope/rope/pull/854\r\n* Avoid printing autoimport syntax errors by @yangfan-yf-yf in https://github.com/python-rope/rope/pull/847\r\n* supports MatchOr, MatchSequence, MatchStar, MatchSingleton by @jheld in https://github.com/python-rope/rope/pull/819\r\n* Handle parentheses around MatchSequence more correctly by @lieryan in https://github.com/python-rope/rope/pull/863\r\n* Add default implementation for is_dir() by @lieryan in https://github.com/python-rope/rope/pull/870\r\n* Fix unicode handling in patched ast by @lieryan in https://github.com/python-rope/rope/pull/872\r\n* Support PEP 695 type parameters on class definitions and type aliases by @marlon-costa-dc in https://github.com/python-rope/rope/pull/845\r\n* docs: resolve warnings by @mcepl in https://github.com/python-rope/rope/pull/849\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @aeliton made their first contribution in https://github.com/python-rope/rope/pull/835\r\n* @yangfan-yf-yf made their first contribution in https://github.com/python-rope/rope/pull/846\r\n* @jheld made their first contribution in https://github.com/python-rope/rope/pull/819\r\n* @marlon-costa-dc made their first contribution in https://github.com/python-rope/rope/pull/845\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/python-rope/rope/compare/1.14.0...1.15.0",
    "discussion_url": "https://github.com/python-rope/rope/discussions/885",
    "mentions_count": 6
