    "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* Isolate tests that uses external_fixturepkg into a venv by @lieryan in https://github.com/python-rope/rope/pull/783\r\n* Refactor movetest.py by @lieryan in https://github.com/python-rope/rope/pull/785\r\n* Update github workflows by @lieryan in https://github.com/python-rope/rope/pull/786\r\n* Add type hints to importinfo.py and add repr to ImportInfo by @lieryan in https://github.com/python-rope/rope/pull/787\r\n* Fix mention of Move -> create_move in docs by @smheidrich in https://github.com/python-rope/rope/pull/795\r\n* Implement preferred_import_style by @lieryan in https://github.com/python-rope/rope/pull/788\r\n* Add explicit sphinx.configuration key by @lieryan in https://github.com/python-rope/rope/pull/820\r\n* Update GHA Python versions by @lieryan in https://github.com/python-rope/rope/pull/805\r\n* Python3.13 compat by @Nowa-Ammerlaan in https://github.com/python-rope/rope/pull/809\r\n* Adapt conditional for Python 3.14 by @penguinpee in https://github.com/python-rope/rope/pull/818\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @smheidrich made their first contribution in https://github.com/python-rope/rope/pull/795\r\n* @Nowa-Ammerlaan made their first contribution in https://github.com/python-rope/rope/pull/809\r\n* @penguinpee made their first contribution in https://github.com/python-rope/rope/pull/818\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/python-rope/rope/compare/1.13.0-rc1...1.14.0",
